<title>UK: AEP, PS Colo. see UK Yorkshire buy accretive.</title>
<headline>AEP, PS Colo. see UK Yorkshire buy accretive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. utilities American Electric Power Co Inc and Public Service Co of Colorado said on Monday they expected their planned acquisition of Britain's Yorkshire Electricity Group Plc to be immediately accretive to their earnings.</p>
</text>
